WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.110
We want to play a quiz 
game with you, meow!

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.980
If you win, you'll get something nice, meow!

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.480
Okay!

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.980
All right, Master, this is a quiz on 
the noises animals make, meow!

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:11.820
Ta-da!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.610
The noises animals make?

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.280
Dogs go "bow-wow." Monkeys go "ook-ook."

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:17.990
Flying squirrels go "chik-chik."

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.120
Giraffes go "moo."

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:22.120
So what noise does a koala make?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.500
Koa-koa?

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:26.130
Bzzt! Wrong!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.000
The answer is...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:02.720
<b>Question 6:  "A. Maid  B. Lieutenant Colonel  C. Little Devil"</b>

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:02.140
No way!

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.230
It's true.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.520
Look, Inoue! Absolute territory!

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:09.140
What? Is this your first time in Akiba?

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:12.070
Yeah. I've been interested 
in coming here for a while,

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.610
Akihabara

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:13.610
but I've never had a chance to visit.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:19.280
Akihabara

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:18.360
Also, well... I-It's my first time 
going somewhere with a friend.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:19.570
Cut that out!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.860
Also, um...

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:21.490
What now?

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.430
Well, you see, my parents bought me this.

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:25.450
A smartphone?

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.210
Um... If it's okay with you...

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.850
Can we exchange contact info?

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.960
Can't you just ask normally?!

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.670
Easy 
Manual

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.850
Huh? But that's not in here.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.840
Why would it?! And don't read the manual!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.300
Please come inside!

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.030
We're holding an event!

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.020
Hey, Yukicchi...

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.520
What's up, Maririn?

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:50.030
Why did the job you said would broaden 
my horizons have to be a maid café?

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.400
Why am I wearing cat ears?!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.830
Well, if you're going to work, don't 
you want to look cute doing it?

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.530
They look great on you, anyway!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.250
Remember, this is to raise 
funds for a set of buzzers.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.380
If anyone I know sees me, 
I'll die of embarrassment!

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:03.910
That'd be a pretty unlikely coincidence.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.230
I know, but...

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.380
Lend me your glasses!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.250
Sasajima-senpai and Jinko-san...

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:15.330
Isn't that the corner of Akiba that's famous 
for all of its electronics wholesale stores?

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:19.810
Oh, man! Seein' all this tech
 gets my heart racin'!

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.630
We're only here to get an estimate today.

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:23.730
Yep, this is the stuff.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.580
How many buttons do we need?

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.640
I'd like to have at least six.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.140
We could use this as our light.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.590
Aw, but this one's totes cuter!

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:33.150
Think about our budget.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.440
Stingy!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.860
What goes inside the control box is more 
important than the buzzers themselves.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.860
Buildin' it the normal way is no fun!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.860
Let's give it some pizzazz!

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:45.810
Please just make a normal set.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:52.180
I haven't been to many arcades before.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.620
I'm kinda nervous...

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.710
We're not here to play around.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.210
This is secret training.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:00.350
After the break, we'll have a 
showdown between our members.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.470
It won't be any fun if 
Fukami-kun wins everything.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:05.010
There's actually a quiz bowl game?

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.220
I'm surprised you knew about it.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.200
Well, when you go to arcades, 
you see this kinda stuff.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.600
